## 🕹️ Verification & How To Run

The launchers can be executed directly from the command line:

### 1. Run the CLI Simulation Loop:
To verify the core engine and modular imports in a standard simulation loop:
```bash
python src/main.py
```

### 2. Launch the Interactive GUI (with Admin Dashboard Tabs & Resident view):
To run the full premium Tkinter interface:
```bash
python src/gui.py
```

> [!TIP]
> **Login Credentials**:
> * **Admin**: Log in using ID `admin` (Password: `admin123`) to view the interactive dashboard tabs.
> * **Resident**: Log in using ID `brent` (Password: `brent123`) to simulate resident waste disposals.
